From 7a93457ca20bb383be0250eb5b472c65020cee52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:29:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cursor): write the model history Cursor 3.24 reads, so a
 resumed chat carries its transcript

Cursor 3.24 sends the model the messages listed in composerData.conversationState
(protobuf field 1: sha256 refs to agentKv:blob:<sha256> AI SDK ModelMessage JSON),
not the bubbles. The projector wrote neither, and stamped _v:16 + agentBackend with
no hasLoaded, so a resumed chat was listed but opened empty and its agent saw no
history (seen 2026-10-19, Cursor 3.24.12). Write the blobs and conversationState,
stamp _v:18 and hasLoaded:true, drop the default agentBackend, as a native chat has.
Live check pending; recorded as a concern on README.md:41. pr/38 record (35 taken).
